, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":191456,"global_rank":350672},{"name":"kklt92/HAproxy-proxy-protocol-parser","owner":"kklt92","html_url":"https://github.com/kklt92/HAproxy-proxy-protocol-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191456,"global_rank":350680},{"name":"cptavatar/cz-parser","owner":"cptavatar","html_url":"https://github.com/cptavatar/cz-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"Just some clojure JSON parsing code to help do a bit more filtering out of vendor files I needed to look at. ","topics":[],"score":191456,"global_rank":350686},{"name":"rlk23/rlk23","owner":"rlk23","html_url":"https://github.com/rlk23/rlk23","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191455,"global_rank":350687},{"name":"SPan-18/SPan-18","owner":"SPan-18","html_url":"https://github.com/SPan-18/SPan-18","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191455,"global_rank":350688},{"name":"JoeLollo21/Music-Data-Curation","owner":"JoeLollo21","html_url":"https://github.com/JoeLollo21/Music-Data-Curation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Curation Protocol project for LIS 545 at UW.","topics":[],"score":191455,"global_rank":350689},{"name":"wellsiau-aws/test-cfn-lint-action","owner":"wellsiau-aws","html_url":"https://github.com